# gamebuilder.org/agents is a chat (issue 29): a message sent in an empty conversation is two
# rows, a new game of the type the control beside the box says (its id, and a key of that send's)
# and then a Builder on the game that answered, the words its job.
# Sent again in that conversation it is a message to the agent; Stop and take back are rows too.
